=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EUnpacking Sitecore\u2019s latest product update event: key takeaways\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn this post we\u2019re going to explore some of the takeaways from the recent Sitecore product update event, and all of the features that were highlighted.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E08 Jul 2025\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/ai/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022AI\u0022\u003EAI\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/sitecore/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Sitecore\u0022\u003ESitecore\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/latest-website-trends-five-takeaways-from-sitecore-s-websites-2025-report/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5